{"ID":"20240118151145-ff0oym3","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151145-ff0oym3","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151145-ff0oym3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151145-21afflr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122125047-9psd99f\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:400,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122125047-9psd99f\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:245,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:245\u0026#125;","title":"173白芷","type":"doc","updated":"20240131170115"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151145-21afflr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151145-21afflr","updated":"20240122125000"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味辛，温，无毒。治女人漏下赤白、血闭、阴肿、寒热、风头侵目泪出，长肌肤。润泽。可作面脂。一名芳香。一名虈。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122125004-nfgei1r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125004-nfgei1r"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】处处有之，根有轮节或隆起，外面色淡黄褐。气味甚香。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122125006-7w0hct0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125006-7w0hct0"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味辛，性温，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122125007-a939mbj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125007-a939mbj"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】白芷为散风表汗要药，功能通窍去湿，疗风行血，止头痛，和肠胃，烧之辟邪气。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122125009-w2ob6fp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125009-w2ob6fp"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】疗风邪，久渴吐呕，两胁满，头眩目痒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122125010-r4ihxkv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125010-r4ihxkv"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】能蚀脓，止心腹血刺痛，女人沥血腰痛血崩。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122125012-q1cjuvn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125012-q1cjuvn"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】治目赤努肉，去面皯疵瘢，补胎漏滑落，破宿血，补新血，乳痈，发背，一切痈疮疥癣，止痛排脓。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122125013-zuwbccs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125013-zuwbccs"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【元素】解利手阳明头痛，中风寒热，及肺经风热，头面皮肤风痹燥痒。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122125015-4m10gs2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125015-4m10gs2"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【灵胎】驱风燥湿。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122125016-tw728ux","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125016-tw728ux"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通五分至钱半。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122125017-vt0jptw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125017-vt0jptw"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】呕吐由于火，漏下赤白，阴虚火炽。病由血热所致者，均忌。恶旋覆花，制雄黄硫黄。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122125019-umljlgb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125019-umljlgb"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【容川】白芷辛香，色白入肺，入阳明陉，根性又主升，故能升散肺与阳明之风寒。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122125000-n1sfy0f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125000-n1sfy0f"}},{"ID":"20240122125019-ui19zyr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125019-ui19zyr"}},{"ID":"20240122125020-arvsqbr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125020-arvsqbr"}},{"ID":"20240122125020-jyu5ouh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125020-jyu5ouh","updated":"20240131165547"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"173，这叫白芷。白芷呢，过去是美容养颜的药，还有呢，治阳明头痛的药。这个白芷，阳明头痛，就是前额痛，额头这边痛就是阳明痛，阳明痛大部分是来自胃。当然你针灸很行，他阳明痛，你针下中脘穴下去，他已经不痛了，你还在找白芷，没找到他已经好了，针灸就是有这个好处，很快哦。"}]},{"ID":"20240122125024-rm5sn8j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125024-rm5sn8j","updated":"20240122125034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那本草经原文呢，味辛，治女人漏下赤白，润泽，可做面脂。因为它熬浓的话，黏黏的，也可以做敷脸哦，我们敷脸的药就会有白芷在里面。内服的话，可以，因为它味道是辛辣的，辛味呢主散，它能够散，所以说呢，风热，那个风束在表面上，这个白芷就可以散风啊，散风，因为它是辛辣的，所以你吃到辣味，一吃全身就开始发汗，因为辛辣，所以它是散风，主治呢，它是散风表汗的要药，能够发表的药。"}]},{"ID":"20240122125038-0pmgwzk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125038-0pmgwzk","updated":"20240122125039"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"『大明』，你看啊，眼睛发赤，赘肉在眼睛里面，乳痈，乳房的硬块，乳癌一切的疮痈都可以使用，诸位，风胜湿，如果说，老师，这个地方湿气太盛了，我们要怎么样把湿气去掉，吹风！湿就会散掉，所以风是胜湿的，所有能够祛风的药都是能够去湿的药，所谓祛风的比如说，这个把风赶动，一赶动，你看，白芷呢，疗风邪，为散风的药，祛风的药，白芷是祛风的药，味道是辛，它主散，所以它能够祛湿，那脸上的【tiao】啊，青春痘，前额痛，那乳房呢，乳房，因为阳明经直接经过乳房，所以乳房的肿，乳癌、乳痈，我们统统可以使用，『元素』他说解利手阳明头痛，手阳明痛就是额头。"}]},{"ID":"20240122125047-9psd99f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125047-9psd99f","updated":"20240131170115"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"唐容川呢，他说，白芷辛香，味道辛香，颜色是白，你刚刚看到啦，色白入肺，又阳明经，根性又主升，所以能升散肺跟阳明的风寒。白芷呢使用的地方。你最主要了解它的功能。我们临床上在使用白芷的时候，是你岳母，白芷用5钱，因为它是入阳明经嘛，白芷里面有油脂，增润皮肤，看起来颜色会很美丽，岳母，我让你吃年轻美丽，青春永驻的药，你相信我，如果你不晓得如何摆平你岳母，我帮你摆平，我保证她服服帖帖，岳母会对你很好，另眼相看。这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"白芷除了内服以外，可以外敷，可以做粉，你用一些绿豆，薏仁那，很多粉哦，泡在里面，我们过去有“玉肌散”，都可以使用。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个美颜的嘛。"}]}]}